  EnPassant = 255
  Halfmove = 0
  Fullmove = 17
  ChessLevel = 2
  ChessFindKings
  ChessFindPreferredMove
  ExpertHangTestFrom = SelectedMoveFrom
  ExpertHangTestTo = SelectedMoveTo

  ' Chess Challenger level 2, ply 97: choose a rook move that avoids mate in one.
  ChessClearBoard
